@startuml

left to right direction

' Akteure
actor "System" as System
actor "Admin" as Admin

' Use Cases
rectangle "Systemintegration" {
  usecase "Keycloak-Authentifizierung" as UC1
  usecase "Admin-Nutzer-Synchronisierung" as UC2

  usecase "Admin-Login validieren" as A1
  usecase "JWT-Token ausstellen" as A2
  usecase "Zugriffsrechte prüfen" as A3
  usecase "Token-Signatur validieren" as A4

  usecase "Admin-User synchronisieren" as B1
  usecase "Rollen/Richtlinien sync" as B2
  usecase "Sicherheitsrichtlinien konfigurieren" as B3
  usecase "Sync-Logging" as B4
}

' Beziehungen
System --> UC1
System --> UC2
Admin --> UC1
Admin --> UC2

UC1 --> A1 : includes
UC1 --> A2 : includes
UC1 --> A3 : includes
UC1 --> A4 : includes

UC2 --> B1 : includes
UC2 --> B2 : includes
UC2 --> B3 : includes
UC2 --> B4 : includes

' Notizen
note right of UC1
  **OAuth2-Flow:**
  - Authorization Code Flow
  - PKCE für öffentliche Clients
  - JWT mit RS256-Signatur
end note

note left of A2
  **Token-Generierung:**
  - Zugriffstoken (15m)
  - Refresh-Token (7d)
  - Custom Claims für Admin-Rollen
end note

note bottom of A3
  **Zugriffskontrolle:**
  1. Realm-Rollen prüfen
  2. Resource-Based Policies
  3. Scope-Validierung
end note

note right of UC2
  **Synchronisierungsregeln:**
  - Einmal pro Stunde
  - Delta-Updates
  - Konfliktlösung: Last-Write-Wins
end note

note left of B3
  **Sicherheitskonfiguration:**
  - Session-Timeout: 1h
  - 2FA-Erzwingung
  - Brute-Force-Schutz
end note

@enduml
